  "description": "Lee Eunjo had it all—money, a husband, a beautiful home... But it all came crashing down as she plummeted to her death. She lost everything after her husband cheated on her, stole from her, and dropped her from the terrace of their high-rise apartment. Luckily, thanks to the help of an AI system called NAVI, her soul went into the body of Na Eunjo, a young model with a stagnating career. Now, Eunjo is back and ready for revenge, stopping at nothing to reclaim everything that was taken from her.\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
